%% title: One run through the five steps
%% caption: Step order is a simplification (INFERENCE).
sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor U as Reviewer
participant UI as Browser UI (r5-generator.html)
participant EX as R5Extract.extractFile
participant PL as runScraper / pipeline.js
participant RV as review.ts
participant GN as generate.ts
U->>UI: Step 1: add plan documents
UI->>EX: extract text and page metadata
EX-->>UI: text + PdfPageMetadata
U->>UI: Step 2: run scraper
UI->>PL: runScraper(documents)
PL-->>UI: PerDocumentExtraction[] per field
UI->>RV: reconcileProvision(field, extractions)
RV-->>UI: ProvisionAnswer[] (one per document)
U->>UI: Step 3: review, edit, approve
UI->>RV: applyAnswerEdit / approvePairExplicitly
Note over RV: any edit resets approval and reopens draft
U->>UI: Step 4: generate
UI->>GN: publishFinal(data, decisions)
GN->>GN: finalBlockers(...)
alt no blockers
  GN-->>UI: ok, data.documentStatus = final
  UI->>GN: buildR5Document(data)
  GN-->>UI: .docx
else blockers
  GN-->>UI: ok=false + blocker list
end
U->>UI: Step 5: download
